            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "How UMH\u2019s New US$91.8 Million Fixed-Rate Loan Will Impact UMH Properties (UMH) Investors",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "UMH Properties, Inc. recently added seven manufactured home communities with 1,765 sites to its Fannie Mae credit facility through Wells Fargo, securing an interest-only US$91.8 million loan at a fixed 5.46% rate for nine years. This refinancing gives UMH added flexibility to pursue acquisitions, community expansions, and rental home investments while temporarily paying down higher-cost debt, potentially reshaping how it funds future growth. Now we\u2019ll examine how this fresh US$91.8 million...",
